{{!-- Breach-undo receipt (cover.js repairCoverWall). Posted when a GM presses the destruction card's
      repair button (or the wall sheet's), so the table sees the map change back rather than only the
      referee. Reports BOTH halves of the restore — the barrier stands again AND its structure is
      full — because either half alone would leave the wall in a state nobody chose. --}}
<div class="cyberpunk cp-cover-repair-card">
    <h3>{{CPLocal "CoverRepairTitle"}}</h3>
    <p>{{CPLocal "CoverRepairLine" name=label}}</p>
    {{#if poolMax}}
    <p class="cp-cover-pool-line">{{CPLocal "CoverPoolLine" pool=pool poolMax=poolMax}}</p>
    {{/if}}
</div>
